        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    bid_rates = [6.2, 6.4, 6.1, 6.5, 6.3, 6.4, 6.0, 6.1]\n    offer_rates = [6.6, 6.7, 6.5, 6.8, 6.7, 6.8, 6.4, 6.5]\n\n    mid_rates = sorted(\n        (bid + offer) / 2\n        for bid, offer in zip(bid_rates, offer_rates)\n    )\n    trimmed_mid_rates = mid_rates[2:-2]\n    jibar_rate = sum(trimmed_mid_rates) / len(trimmed_mid_rates)\n\n    return round(jibar_rate, 2)\n```",
